            "A stone of grounding, independence and inner exploration, said to help clarify motivations and keep one's feet on the ground. It is associated with the throat and third-eye chakras and the sign of Aquarius. Do not soak it; cleanse by smudging; recharge in moonlight or on a quartz cluster."
